          "title": "Shortcut Dasar",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Ctrl+Z** \u2014 Undo \u2022 **Ctrl+Shift+Z** \u2014 Redo\n\u2022 **Ctrl+C** \u2014 Copy \u2022 **Ctrl+V** \u2014 Paste\n\u2022 **Delete** \u2014 Hapus node/grup\n\u2022 **Space + Drag** \u2014 Pan canvas\n\u2022 **Scroll** \u2014 Zoom \u2022 **Shift + Klik** \u2014 Multi-select",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;\"><kbd style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:7px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+Z</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:7px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+C</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:7px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Ctrl+V</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:7px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Delete</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:7px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Space+Drag</kbd><kbd style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:7px;font-family:monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Shift+Klik</kbd></div><div style=\"padding:0 12px 8px;display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:6px;color:#6366f1;\">Undo: Ctrl+Z</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:6px;color:#6366f1;\">Redo: Ctrl+Shift+Z</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tips",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Undo sampai 50 langkah ke belakang\n\u2022 Copy-paste node antar rule\n\u2022 Multi-select dulu, baru aksi (delete/copy/pindah)\n\u2022 Space+Drag lebih cepat dari scroll",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdfa,#fff);border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">\u21a9\ufe0f Undo 50 langkah</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">\ud83d\udccb Copy antar rule</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">\u2795 Multi-select</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">\u270b Space+Drag</span></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
